Here is a sample `BankAccount` class and the required method:

```csharp
using System;

public class BankAccount
{
    public string Name { get; set; }
    public double Balance { get; set; }

    public void SetBalance(double amount)
    {
        Balance = amount;
    }

    public string ShowUserNameAndBalance()
    {
        // Format the cents to always be two digits
        double roundedBalance = Math.Round(Balance, 2);
        string balanceStr = roundedBalance.ToString("F2");

        // Format the dollar sign and negative sign
        string formattedBalance = roundedBalance < 0 ? $"-{balanceStr}" : balanceStr;

        return $"{Name}, ${formattedBalance}";
    }
}
```

